sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Web/Mobile UI
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant AUTH as Auth Service
    participant PROF as Profile Service

    UI->>GW: POST /auth/register
    GW->>AUTH: Register(user)
    AUTH-->>GW: 201 Created + userId
    GW->>PROF: InitProfile(userId)
    PROF-->>GW: 201 Created
    GW-->>UI: 200 OK

    UI->>GW: POST /auth/login
    GW->>AUTH: IssueTokens(credentials)
    AUTH-->>GW: accessToken/refreshToken
    GW-->>UI: 200 OK + tokens


